{"2488290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RUSHING BEAT X: Return Of Brawl Brothers", "steam_appid": 2488290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4372090], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neo-Cisco has been shaken by the Joecal crime syndicate and the deadly Zeekus virus. But each time, justice has prevailed thanks to a small band of brave fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, they must rise up again to face an overwhelming evil and discover the true mastermind behind these past events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New moves, new weapons, and new allies mix in this ultimate Beat 'em up, Rushing Beat. Restore peace to the streets in the hot 2-player co-op story mode that doubles the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/74bd753963c4b4c71f4a3cbb5e7b6693.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/74bd753963c4b4c71f4a3cbb5e7b6693.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/74bd753963c4b4c71f4a3cbb5e7b6693.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With easy-to-use auto-combos, even beginners can enjoy exhilarating action. Chain together your own combos with various actions like counterattacks, follow-up strikes, and weapon-based attacks. Most actions can be canceled with dashes or jumps. Master the cancel system and unleash even more consecutive attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw techniques can be varied with key inputs. Send your targeted enemies flying, and if you throw them into the background, you can destroy normally unreachable objects. A chance to get items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you land hits or take damage, your rage gauge increases. When the gauge reaches MAX, you enter rage mode. In addition to enhanced attack and defense, you can unleash the finishing move &quot;Beat Rush&quot;. Defeat evil with righteous fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆CHAPTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 9 stages in total. Defeat enemies waiting in various areas such as shopping malls, slums, subways, and laboratories, and chase the truth of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions also occur in each scene. Challenge the capture of various actions and stage gimmicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable characters increase as the story progresses, bringing the team to a total of 6 members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique actions different for each fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, this title supports 2-player co-op. Advance with your allies on the path to The Peace Keepers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4efa48a456d22825f4f0a70196dfa24b.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4efa48a456d22825f4f0a70196dfa24b.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4efa48a456d22825f4f0a70196dfa24b.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯RICK NORTON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Mixed Martial Arts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/686aab248f6fd7e6676bc76225b76e10.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/686aab248f6fd7e6676bc76225b76e10.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/686aab248f6fd7e6676bc76225b76e10.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owner of the mixed martial arts gym Norton Gym, and a former detective of the Neo-Cisco State Police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing that the incidents surrounding the Zeekus virus are not yet over, he continues his investigation alongside his sister Maria and his friend Bild. He also trains the next generation, including Kahlua, a girl suspected of having been a test subject in the Cyber Clone Project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For expeditions and investigations, he owns the heavily modified military armored vehicle Tough Enough, a special combat-ready food truck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯DOUGLAS BILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Pro Wrestling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4448a8422f65de370e6ceb838cffe67e.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4448a8422f65de370e6ceb838cffe67e.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4448a8422f65de370e6ceb838cffe67e.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former professional wrestler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the aftermath of the Cyber Clone Incident, he rescued Kahlua, who had been imprisoned as a test subject for Zeekus experiments. Like Rick, he continues to investigate the truth behind Zeekus, and the Joecal and Cyber Clone incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recently, his workload has expanded to include cases involving unidentified bioforms, leaving him busier than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯LORD J.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Koppojutsu, Jujitsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/94ee7bc7ce7488029a87d70456f85e31.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/94ee7bc7ce7488029a87d70456f85e31.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/94ee7bc7ce7488029a87d70456f85e31.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lord J joined Norton Gym at Rick's invitation, as Rick had an interest in Japanese martial arts. Before long, Lord J became entangled in the Cyber Clone Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He shows a particular interest in the Zeekus-based body enhancements once used by Kintark. His driving force is the pursuit of greater strength and the desire to evolve as a fighter. He is even willing to rely on Zeekus itself if it means achieving that goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯WENDY MILAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Pro Wrestling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/bf9a76494aed77a4c668dd05eccc1a63.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/bf9a76494aed77a4c668dd05eccc1a63.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/bf9a76494aed77a4c668dd05eccc1a63.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rookie female pro wrestler, newly debuted and full of promise, who trains at Norton Gym on Bild’s recommendation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She holds deep gratitude toward both Norton, who serves as her trainer, and Bild, who guides her as a senior wrestler. On her days off, she also supports them by acting as a contact for investigations related to Zeekus. Wendy has potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯KAZAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Togakure Ninjutsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/1edaa9d13fbbf7199725d6ca08f0b7d4.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/1edaa9d13fbbf7199725d6ca08f0b7d4.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/1edaa9d13fbbf7199725d6ca08f0b7d4.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kazan first met Bild during the aftermath of the Joecal Incident, when the police cooperated with the CIA. After retiring from the CIA, he was introduced to Norton and, like Bild, occasionally served as an instructor. He was later drawn into the Cyber Clone Incident. Since then, Bild has entrusted him with certain off-the-record investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While pursuing the truth behind Zeekus alongside Bild and the others, Kazan also hunts rogue mercenaries who misuse Togakure Ninjutsu for criminal purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯KAHLUA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Self-Taught</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/a378be3557e138756090128753095638.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/a378be3557e138756090128753095638.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/a378be3557e138756090128753095638.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kahlua was rescued by Bild and the police after being abducted during the Cyber Clone Incident. Due to Zeekus experimentation, she lost all memories except for her name. As her registration data had been erased from official records, her identity remained unknown. With no family to return to, she was placed in the care of Norton Gym until her memories could recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her fighting style is entirely self-taught, learned from online videos and imitation. Whether by natural talent or instinct, she is able to grasp techniques with surprising speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆FOOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you board the kitchen car Tough enough, which is also a checkpoint of the stage, you can combine the food items you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combo menu made with 3 types of food increases the recovery amount. Furthermore, special effects may be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether attacking or eating, combos are recommended!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/173e8fd3d189f9587ec58f49e7a71a11.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/173e8fd3d189f9587ec58f49e7a71a11.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/173e8fd3d189f9587ec58f49e7a71a11.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neo-Cisco has been shaken by the Joecal crime syndicate and the deadly Zeekus virus. But each time, justice has prevailed thanks to a small band of brave fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, they must rise up again to face an overwhelming evil and discover the true mastermind behind these past events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New moves, new weapons, and new allies mix in this ultimate Beat 'em up, Rushing Beat. Restore peace to the streets in the hot 2-player co-op story mode that doubles the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/74bd753963c4b4c71f4a3cbb5e7b6693.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/74bd753963c4b4c71f4a3cbb5e7b6693.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/74bd753963c4b4c71f4a3cbb5e7b6693.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With easy-to-use auto-combos, even beginners can enjoy exhilarating action. Chain together your own combos with various actions like counterattacks, follow-up strikes, and weapon-based attacks. Most actions can be canceled with dashes or jumps. Master the cancel system and unleash even more consecutive attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw techniques can be varied with key inputs. Send your targeted enemies flying, and if you throw them into the background, you can destroy normally unreachable objects. A chance to get items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you land hits or take damage, your rage gauge increases. When the gauge reaches MAX, you enter rage mode. In addition to enhanced attack and defense, you can unleash the finishing move &quot;Beat Rush&quot;. Defeat evil with righteous fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆CHAPTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 9 stages in total. Defeat enemies waiting in various areas such as shopping malls, slums, subways, and laboratories, and chase the truth of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions also occur in each scene. Challenge the capture of various actions and stage gimmicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable characters increase as the story progresses, bringing the team to a total of 6 members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique actions different for each fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, this title supports 2-player co-op. Advance with your allies on the path to The Peace Keepers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4efa48a456d22825f4f0a70196dfa24b.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4efa48a456d22825f4f0a70196dfa24b.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4efa48a456d22825f4f0a70196dfa24b.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯RICK NORTON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Mixed Martial Arts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/686aab248f6fd7e6676bc76225b76e10.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/686aab248f6fd7e6676bc76225b76e10.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/686aab248f6fd7e6676bc76225b76e10.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owner of the mixed martial arts gym Norton Gym, and a former detective of the Neo-Cisco State Police.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing that the incidents surrounding the Zeekus virus are not yet over, he continues his investigation alongside his sister Maria and his friend Bild. He also trains the next generation, including Kahlua, a girl suspected of having been a test subject in the Cyber Clone Project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For expeditions and investigations, he owns the heavily modified military armored vehicle Tough Enough, a special combat-ready food truck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯DOUGLAS BILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Pro Wrestling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4448a8422f65de370e6ceb838cffe67e.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4448a8422f65de370e6ceb838cffe67e.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/4448a8422f65de370e6ceb838cffe67e.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former professional wrestler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the aftermath of the Cyber Clone Incident, he rescued Kahlua, who had been imprisoned as a test subject for Zeekus experiments. Like Rick, he continues to investigate the truth behind Zeekus, and the Joecal and Cyber Clone incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recently, his workload has expanded to include cases involving unidentified bioforms, leaving him busier than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯LORD J.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Koppojutsu, Jujitsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/94ee7bc7ce7488029a87d70456f85e31.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/94ee7bc7ce7488029a87d70456f85e31.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/94ee7bc7ce7488029a87d70456f85e31.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lord J joined Norton Gym at Rick's invitation, as Rick had an interest in Japanese martial arts. Before long, Lord J became entangled in the Cyber Clone Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He shows a particular interest in the Zeekus-based body enhancements once used by Kintark. His driving force is the pursuit of greater strength and the desire to evolve as a fighter. He is even willing to rely on Zeekus itself if it means achieving that goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯WENDY MILAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Pro Wrestling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/bf9a76494aed77a4c668dd05eccc1a63.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/bf9a76494aed77a4c668dd05eccc1a63.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/bf9a76494aed77a4c668dd05eccc1a63.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rookie female pro wrestler, newly debuted and full of promise, who trains at Norton Gym on Bild’s recommendation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She holds deep gratitude toward both Norton, who serves as her trainer, and Bild, who guides her as a senior wrestler. On her days off, she also supports them by acting as a contact for investigations related to Zeekus. Wendy has potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯KAZAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Togakure Ninjutsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/1edaa9d13fbbf7199725d6ca08f0b7d4.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/1edaa9d13fbbf7199725d6ca08f0b7d4.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/1edaa9d13fbbf7199725d6ca08f0b7d4.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kazan first met Bild during the aftermath of the Joecal Incident, when the police cooperated with the CIA. After retiring from the CIA, he was introduced to Norton and, like Bild, occasionally served as an instructor. He was later drawn into the Cyber Clone Incident. Since then, Bild has entrusted him with certain off-the-record investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While pursuing the truth behind Zeekus alongside Bild and the others, Kazan also hunts rogue mercenaries who misuse Togakure Ninjutsu for criminal purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯KAHLUA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Battle Style】Self-Taught</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/a378be3557e138756090128753095638.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=840 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/a378be3557e138756090128753095638.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/a378be3557e138756090128753095638.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kahlua was rescued by Bild and the police after being abducted during the Cyber Clone Incident. Due to Zeekus experimentation, she lost all memories except for her name. As her registration data had been erased from official records, her identity remained unknown. With no family to return to, she was placed in the care of Norton Gym until her memories could recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her fighting style is entirely self-taught, learned from online videos and imitation. Whether by natural talent or instinct, she is able to grasp techniques with surprising speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆FOOD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you board the kitchen car Tough enough, which is also a checkpoint of the stage, you can combine the food items you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combo menu made with 3 types of food increases the recovery amount. Furthermore, special effects may be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether attacking or eating, combos are recommended!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/173e8fd3d189f9587ec58f49e7a71a11.poster.avif?t=1781700151\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/173e8fd3d189f9587ec58f49e7a71a11.webm?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/173e8fd3d189f9587ec58f49e7a71a11.mp4?t=1781700151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The legendary beat ’em up series from Jaleco returns. Master trained fighters take on a rising evil with raw strength and refined technique. Built around easy-to-use auto-combos, the game lets skilled players weave powerful strings for exhilarating combat. Let your fists burn with fury once more.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/header.jpg?t=1781700151", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781700151", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781700151", "website": "https://city-connection.co.jp/rushingbeatx/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-8500 3.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3.5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux